{"productId": "cdb83d35-aa35-44d2-991d-2a5d531b66aa", "modelName": "600+ Range", "modelDescription": "The CZ 600+ RANGE is a precision bolt-action rifle built for sport shooting and medium to long-range hunting. Each rifle is factory tested and guaranteed to deliver sub-0.75 MOA five-shot groups at 100 meters with match-grade ammunition. It features a steel receiver compatible with Remington 700-style optics mounts and a laminated wood stock designed for stability and comfort, complete with a tool-free adjustable cheekpiece and a forend shaped for cooling and control. At its core is a heavy, cold hammer-forged barrel tailored to its caliber, threaded at the muzzle for use with brakes or suppressors. The rifle is equipped with a user-adjustable single-stage trigger offering four pull-weight settings, along with CZ\u2019s patented controlled feed system and a silent ergonomic safety for reliable operation in any position. A magazine lock option allows either removable or fixed-feed use, while a spring-loaded bolt release ensures safe disassembly without touching the trigger. ", "manufacturerName": "CZ-USA", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": true, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "03c4ee26-699d-48af-b7e7-e2e222d7bec3", "description": "CZ, 600+ Range, Bolt Action, 308 Winchester, 24\" Threaded Barrel, Blued Finish, Adjustable Laminate Stock, Right Hand, 5 Round Capacity", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/ServiceImageUpload/6df9c524-a7a1-4235-81b7-3e1e0a450765/6585ef5c-753a-4d98-a475-962de85f68a8", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/d20a1d5f-4e5a-4531-9f4e-dfff919810ad", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/b7acc9aa-c21f-4bc4-b183-aec3163fa53c", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/db212b03-f353-427b-ba6d-ab49a7e4b874", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/a76c55f4-7b8f-4368-bc41-3bac9c10fe70", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/c6cc3639-94a4-455f-bbc5-202fe83ce5dc", "https://main-images.